<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n51687" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κᾰθαρ-ίζω</span></b> , fut.
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ιῶ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Ep.Hebr.</u>
					9.14
				</span></i>
			:—<i>cleanse</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θυσιαστήριον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					LXX
					<u>Ex.</u>
					29.36
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>Ev.Matt.</u>
				23.25
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Act.Ap.</u>
				10.15
			</span></i>; <i>sift</i> grain, <i><span class="en">
				<u>PStrassb.</u>
				2.11
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iii A.D.)</span>; <i>prune away</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περισσὰ βλαστήματα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>PLond.</u>
					1.131r192
				</span></i>
			
			<span class="entity">(i A.D.)</span>; <i>clear</i> ground of weeds, etc., <i><span class="en">
				<u>PLips.</u>
				111.12
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iv A.D.)</span>; <i>keep</i> a precinct <i>clear</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπό τινων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>IG</u>
					5(1).1390.37
				</span></i>
			 (Andania, <span class="entity">i B.C.</span>):—in 
				Med.
			, fut.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ιοῦμαι</span>, of the menses, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Superf.</u>
				43
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> of persons,
				<i>purify</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπὸ ἁμαρτίας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					LXX
					<u>Si.</u>
					38.10
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπὸ παντὸς μολυσμοῦ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>2 Ep.Cor.</u>
					7.1
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὴν συνείδησιν ἀπὸ νεκρῶν ἔργων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Ep.Hebr.</u>
					9.14
				</span></i>
			; <i>cleanse</i> from leprosy, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Ev.Matt.</u>
				8.2
			</span></i> (and in 
				Pass.
			, of the disease, ib.<i><span class="en">
				3
			</span></i>):—
				Pass.
			, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ιζέστω ἀπὸ γυναικός
			κτλ</span>. <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				22.1366.4
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				1365
			</span></i>.</div>
